sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Java sender
    participant R as Java receiver
    S->>R: START metadata and proposed chunk size
    R->>S: READY agreed chunk size
    S->>R: DATA sequence 0 with CRC
    R->>S: ACK sequence 0
    S--xR: DATA sequence 1 lost
    Note over S: Timeout for sequence 1
    S->>R: Retransmit DATA sequence 1
    R->>S: ACK sequence 1
    Note over S,R: Continue within the sending window
    S->>R: FIN expected file hash
    Note over R: Check all chunks and file hash
    R--xS: DONE verified hash lost
    Note over S: Completion timeout
    S->>R: Retransmit FIN
    Note over R: Keep verified state during linger
    R->>S: Resend DONE
    Note over S: Report transfer completed
